bbcode_enabled = true
text = "Because of thirst the infant’s tongue
sticks to the roof of its mouth;
The children beg for bread, 
but no one gives it to them.
- Lamentations 4:4

In the end, your civilization fell to starvation rather than floodwaters. Matters of human mismanagement are as deadly as natural disasters.

Your civilization survived 5 floods and climbed 7 layers. You built 28 buildings and 32 platforms. "
